  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Uzbekistan PPP Project Development Facility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The provision of a sovereign loan of up to US$ 10 million (&#x20ac;10 million) to the  Republic of Uzbekistan (RoU) to fund its contribution to the new Uzbekistan PPP  Project Development Facility (UPDF), which will be set up to finance the  preparation costs of public private partnership (PPP) projects in Uzbekistan  (the Project).  The project will secure a dedicated pot of funding needed to prepare a series  of priority PPPs for the market in a streamlined programmatic manner.</narrative>
  </description>
